41:35.660 --> 41:36.660
Namun, baru saja,

41:38.140 --> 41:40.400
memori Pohon Suci sudah memberitahuku.

41:41.450 --> 41:42.850
Asalkan setelah pewaris

41:43.820 --> 41:45.080
